{
  "borough": "London Borough of Barking and Dagenham",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed development would introduce a new takeaway to the Neighbourhood Centre, which would sit in close proximity to several schools within 400m of the site; those of which include Mayfield School, Goodmayes Primary School, Henry Green Primary School, and St Vincent&#39; s Primary School. This is in direct conflict with London Plan Policy E9.&nbsp; It fails to demonstrate that other benefits, including contribution to the vitality of the district centre, would suitably outweigh the benefits of the proposal. As such, the proposal is found to be in conflict with the following policies:National Planning Policy Framework (December 2023)Policies SD6, SD8 and E9 of the London Plan (March 2021)Policies DME 3 of the Barking and Dagenham Local Plan (September, 2024)"
  ],
